 ### Analytic Gradient Approximations
-Methods that derive explicit formulas for the gradient of the rasterization operation, particularly for visibility changes. Neural Mesh Renderer (NMR) [KUH18] approximates the backward gradient using a handcrafted function for visibility changes [S1, unofficial]. Paparazzi [LTJ18] uses image filters for analytic differentiable rendering [S1, unofficial].
