 ### Soft Blending and Probabilistic Maps
-Techniques that render probabilistic maps of mesh triangles to allow gradient flow to occluded vertices. Soft Rasterizer [LLCL19] aggregates these probabilistic maps [S1, unofficial]. Pix2Vex [PBDCO19] uses $C^\infty$ differentiable soft blending schemes of nearby triangles [S1, unofficial].
